{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالطُّورِ","d":"wal-ṭūri","e":"By the Mount"}],"a":{"g":"By the mount"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَكِتَابٍ","d":"wakitābin","e":"And by (the) Book"},{"c":"مَسْطُورٍ","d":"masṭūrin","e":"written"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] a Book inscribed"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"رَقٍّ","d":"raqqin","e":"parchment"},{"c":"مَنْشُورٍ","d":"manshūrin","e":"unrolled"}],"a":{"g":"In parchment spread open"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْبَيْتِ","d":"wal-bayti","e":"By the House"},{"c":"الْمَعْمُورِ","d":"l-maʿmūri","e":"frequented"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the frequented House"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَالسَّقْفِ","d":"wal-saqfi","e":"By the roof"},{"c":"الْمَرْفُوعِ","d":"l-marfūʿi","e":"raised high"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the heaven raised high"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْبَحْرِ","d":"wal-baḥri","e":"By the sea"},{"c":"الْمَسْجُورِ","d":"l-masjūri","e":"filled"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the sea filled [with fire],"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"عَذَابَ","d":"ʿadhāba","e":"(the) punishment"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"لَوَاقِعٌ","d":"lawāqiʿun","e":"(will) surely occur"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the punishment of your Lord will occur."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"دَافِعٍ","d":"dāfiʿin","e":"preventer"}],"a":{"g":"Of it there is no preventer."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(On the) Day"},{"c":"تَمُورُ","d":"tamūru","e":"will shake"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"مَوْرًا","d":"mawran","e":"(with violent) shake"}],"a":{"g":"On the Day the heaven will sway with circular motion"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَسِيرُ","d":"watasīru","e":"And will move away"},{"c":"الْجِبَالُ","d":"l-jibālu","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"سَيْرًا","d":"sayran","e":"(with an awful) movement"}],"a":{"g":"And the mountains will pass on, departing -"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"فَوَيْلٌ","d":"fawaylun","e":"Then woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Then woe, that Day, to the deniers,"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"خَوْضٍ","d":"khawḍin","e":"(vain) discourse"},{"c":"يَلْعَبُونَ","d":"yalʿabūna","e":"are playing"}],"a":{"g":"Who are in [empty] discourse amusing themselves."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يُدَعُّونَ","d":"yudaʿʿūna","e":"they will be thrust"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"(in)to"},{"c":"نَارِ","d":"nāri","e":"(the) Fire"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"(of) Hell"},{"c":"دَعًّا","d":"daʿʿan","e":"(with) a thrust"}],"a":{"g":"The Day they are thrust toward the fire of Hell with a [violent] thrust, [its angels will say],"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"هَذِهِ","d":"hādhihi","e":"This"},{"c":"النَّارُ","d":"l-nāru","e":"(is) the Fire"},{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"which"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"بِهَا","d":"bihā","e":"[of it]"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","d":"tukadhibūna","e":"deny"}],"a":{"g":"\"This is the Fire which you used to deny."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَسِحْرٌ","d":"afasiḥ'run","e":"Then is this magic"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"Then is this magic"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"you"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"تُبْصِرُونَ","d":"tub'ṣirūna","e":"see"}],"a":{"g":"Then is this magic, or do you not see?"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"اصْلَوْهَا","d":"iṣ'lawhā","e":"Burn in it"},{"c":"فَاصْبِرُوا","d":"fa-iṣ'birū","e":"then be patient"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"تَصْبِرُوا","d":"taṣbirū","e":"be patient"},{"c":"سَوَاءٌ","d":"sawāon","e":"(it is) same"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"for you"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"تُجْزَوْنَ","d":"tuj'zawna","e":"you are being recompensed"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(for) what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"[Enter to] burn therein; then be patient or impatient - it is all the same for you. You are only being recompensed [for] what you used to do.\""}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"l-mutaqīna","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"Gardens"},{"c":"وَنَعِيمٍ","d":"wanaʿīmin","e":"and pleasure"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be in gardens and pleasure,"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"فَاكِهِينَ","d":"fākihīna","e":"Enjoying"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"in what"},{"c":"ءَاتَاهُمْ","d":"ātāhum","e":"has given them"},{"c":"رَبُّهُمْ","d":"rabbuhum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"وَوَقَاهُمْ","d":"wawaqāhum","e":"and protected them"},{"c":"رَبُّهُمْ","d":"rabbuhum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"عَذَابَ","d":"ʿadhāba","e":"(from the) punishment"},{"c":"الْجَحِيمِ","d":"l-jaḥīmi","e":"(of) Hellfire"}],"a":{"g":"Enjoying what their Lord has given them, and their Lord protected them from the punishment of Hellfire."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"كُلُوا","d":"kulū","e":"Eat"},{"c":"وَاشْرَبُوا","d":"wa-ish'rabū","e":"and drink"},{"c":"هَنِيئًا","d":"hanīan","e":"(in) satisfaction"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"[They will be told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do.\""}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"مُتَّكِئِينَ","d":"muttakiīna","e":"Reclining"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"سُرُرٍ","d":"sururin","e":"thrones"},{"c":"مَصْفُوفَةٍ","d":"maṣfūfatin","e":"lined up"},{"c":"وَزَوَّجْنَاهُمْ","d":"wazawwajnāhum","e":"and We will marry them"},{"c":"بِحُورٍ","d":"biḥūrin","e":"to fair ones"},{"c":"عِينٍ","d":"ʿīnin","e":"with large eyes"}],"a":{"g":"They will be reclining on thrones lined up, and We will marry them to fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believed"},{"c":"وَاتَّبَعَتْهُمْ","d":"wa-ittabaʿathum","e":"and followed them"},{"c":"ذُرِّيَّتُهُمْ","d":"dhurriyyatuhum","e":"their offspring"},{"c":"بِإِيمَانٍ","d":"biīmānin","e":"in faith"},{"c":"أَلْحَقْنَا","d":"alḥaqnā","e":"We will join"},{"c":"بِهِمْ","d":"bihim","e":"with them"},{"c":"ذُرِّيَّتَهُمْ","d":"dhurriyyatahum","e":"their offspring"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَلَتْنَاهُمْ","d":"alatnāhum","e":"We will deprive them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"عَمَلِهِمْ","d":"ʿamalihim","e":"their deeds"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(in) any"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"Every"},{"c":"امْرِئٍ","d":"im'ri-in","e":"person"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"كَسَبَ","d":"kasaba","e":"he earned"},{"c":"رَهِينٌ","d":"rahīnun","e":"(is) pledged"}],"a":{"g":"And those who believed and whose descendants followed them in faith - We will join with them their descendants, and We will not deprive them of anything of their deeds. Every person, for what he earned, is retained."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمْدَدْنَاهُمْ","d":"wa-amdadnāhum","e":"And We will provide them"},{"c":"بِفَاكِهَةٍ","d":"bifākihatin","e":"with fruit"},{"c":"وَلَحْمٍ","d":"walaḥmin","e":"and meat"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"from what"},{"c":"يَشْتَهُونَ","d":"yashtahūna","e":"they desire"}],"a":{"g":"And We will provide them with fruit and meat from whatever they desire."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"يَتَنَازَعُونَ","d":"yatanāzaʿūna","e":"They will pass to one another"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"كَأْسًا","d":"kasan","e":"a cup"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"no"},{"c":"لَغْوٌ","d":"laghwun","e":"ill speech"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and no"},{"c":"تَأْثِيمٌ","d":"tathīmun","e":"sin"}],"a":{"g":"They will exchange with one another a cup [of wine] wherein [results] no ill speech or commission of sin."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَطُوفُ","d":"wayaṭūfu","e":"And will circulate"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"among them"},{"c":"غِلْمَانٌ","d":"ghil'mānun","e":"boys"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","d":"ka-annahum","e":"as if they (were)"},{"c":"لُؤْلُؤٌ","d":"lu'lu-on","e":"pearls"},{"c":"مَكْنُونٌ","d":"maknūnun","e":"well-protected"}],"a":{"g":"There will circulate among them [servant] boys [especially] for them, as if they were pearls well-protected."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَقْبَلَ","d":"wa-aqbala","e":"And will approach"},{"c":"بَعْضُهُمْ","d":"baʿḍuhum","e":"some of them"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"بَعْضٍ","d":"baʿḍin","e":"others"},{"c":"يَتَسَاءَلُونَ","d":"yatasāalūna","e":"inquiring"}],"a":{"g":"And they will approach one another, inquiring of each other."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They will say"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"[we] were"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"among"},{"c":"أَهْلِنَا","d":"ahlinā","e":"our families"},{"c":"مُشْفِقِينَ","d":"mush'fiqīna","e":"fearful"}],"a":{"g":"They will say, \"Indeed, we were previously among our people fearful [of displeasing Allah]."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَنَّ","d":"famanna","e":"But Allah conferred favor"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"But Allah conferred favor"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"upon us"},{"c":"وَوَقَانَا","d":"wawaqānā","e":"and protected us"},{"c":"عَذَابَ","d":"ʿadhāba","e":"(from the) punishment"},{"c":"السَّمُومِ","d":"l-samūmi","e":"(of) the Scorching Fire"}],"a":{"g":"So Allah conferred favor upon us and protected us from the punishment of the Scorching Fire."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed, we"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"[we] used (to)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"نَدْعُوهُ","d":"nadʿūhu","e":"call Him"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed, He"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"[He]"},{"c":"الْبَرُّ","d":"l-baru","e":"(is) the Most Kind"},{"c":"الرَّحِيمُ","d":"l-raḥīmu","e":"the Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, we used to supplicate Him before. Indeed, it is He who is the Beneficent, the Merciful.\""}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"فَذَكِّرْ","d":"fadhakkir","e":"Therefore remind"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"for not"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"you"},{"c":"بِنِعْمَتِ","d":"biniʿ'mati","e":"(are) by (the) grace"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"بِكَاهِنٍ","d":"bikāhinin","e":"a soothsayer"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"مَجْنُونٍ","d":"majnūnin","e":"a madman"}],"a":{"g":"So remind [O Muhammad], for you are not, by the favor of your Lord, a soothsayer or a madman."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"(do) they say"},{"c":"شَاعِرٌ","d":"shāʿirun","e":"A poet"},{"c":"نَتَرَبَّصُ","d":"natarabbaṣu","e":"we wait"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"for him"},{"c":"رَيْبَ","d":"rayba","e":"a misfortune of time"},{"c":"الْمَنُونِ","d":"l-manūni","e":"a misfortune of time"}],"a":{"g":"Or do they say [of you], \"A poet for whom we await a misfortune of time?\""}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"تَرَبَّصُوا","d":"tarabbaṣū","e":"Wait"},{"c":"فَإِنِّي","d":"fa-innī","e":"for indeed I am"},{"c":"مَعَكُمْ","d":"maʿakum","e":"with you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"among"},{"c":"الْمُتَرَبِّصِينَ","d":"l-mutarabiṣīna","e":"those who wait"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Wait, for indeed I am, with you, among the waiters.\""}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"تَأْمُرُهُمْ","d":"tamuruhum","e":"command them"},{"c":"أَحْلَامُهُمْ","d":"aḥlāmuhum","e":"their minds"},{"c":"بِهَذَا","d":"bihādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"قَوْمٌ","d":"qawmun","e":"(are) a people"},{"c":"طَاغُونَ","d":"ṭāghūna","e":"transgressing"}],"a":{"g":"Or do their minds command them to [say] this, or are they a transgressing people?"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"(do) they say"},{"c":"تَقَوَّلَهُ","d":"taqawwalahu","e":"He has made it up"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"yu'minūna","e":"they believe"}],"a":{"g":"Or do they say, \"He has made it up\"? Rather, they do not believe."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"فَلْيَأْتُوا","d":"falyatū","e":"Then let them bring"},{"c":"بِحَدِيثٍ","d":"biḥadīthin","e":"a statement"},{"c":"مِثْلِهِ","d":"mith'lihi","e":"like it"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they"},{"c":"صَادِقِينَ","d":"ṣādiqīna","e":"(are) truthful"}],"a":{"g":"Then let them produce a statement like it, if they should be truthful."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"خُلِقُوا","d":"khuliqū","e":"were they created"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"غَيْرِ","d":"ghayri","e":"nothing"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"nothing"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"(are) they"},{"c":"الْخَالِقُونَ","d":"l-khāliqūna","e":"the creators"}],"a":{"g":"Or were they created by nothing, or were they the creators [of themselves]?"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"خَلَقُوا","d":"khalaqū","e":"(did) they create"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُوقِنُونَ","d":"yūqinūna","e":"they are certain"}],"a":{"g":"Or did they create the heavens and the earth? Rather, they are not certain."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"عِنْدَهُمْ","d":"ʿindahum","e":"with them"},{"c":"خَزَائِنُ","d":"khazāinu","e":"(are the) treasures"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"(are) they"},{"c":"الْمُصَيْطِرُونَ","d":"l-muṣayṭirūna","e":"the controllers"}],"a":{"g":"Or have they the depositories [containing the provision] of your Lord? Or are they the controllers [of them]?"}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"سُلَّمٌ","d":"sullamun","e":"(is) a stairway"},{"c":"يَسْتَمِعُونَ","d":"yastamiʿūna","e":"they listen"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"therewith"},{"c":"فَلْيَأْتِ","d":"falyati","e":"Then let bring"},{"c":"مُسْتَمِعُهُمْ","d":"mus'tamiʿuhum","e":"their listener"},{"c":"بِسُلْطَانٍ","d":"bisul'ṭānin","e":"an authority"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Or have they a stairway [into the heaven] upon which they listen? Then let their listener produce a clear authority."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for Him"},{"c":"الْبَنَاتُ","d":"l-banātu","e":"(are) daughters"},{"c":"وَلَكُمُ","d":"walakumu","e":"while for you"},{"c":"الْبَنُونَ","d":"l-banūna","e":"(are) sons"}],"a":{"g":"Or has He daughters while you have sons?"}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"تَسْءَلُهُمْ","d":"tasaluhum","e":"(do) you ask from them"},{"c":"أَجْرًا","d":"ajran","e":"a payment"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَغْرَمٍ","d":"maghramin","e":"a debt"},{"c":"مُثْقَلُونَ","d":"muth'qalūna","e":"(are) overburdened"}],"a":{"g":"Or do you, [O Muhammad], ask of them a payment, so they are by debt burdened down?"}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"عِنْدَهُمُ","d":"ʿindahumu","e":"with them"},{"c":"الْغَيْبُ","d":"l-ghaybu","e":"(is) the unseen"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"يَكْتُبُونَ","d":"yaktubūna","e":"write (it) down"}],"a":{"g":"Or have they [knowledge of] the unseen, so they write [it] down?"}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"يُرِيدُونَ","d":"yurīdūna","e":"(do) they intend"},{"c":"كَيْدًا","d":"kaydan","e":"a plot"},{"c":"فَالَّذِينَ","d":"fa-alladhīna","e":"But those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"themselves"},{"c":"الْمَكِيدُونَ","d":"l-makīdūna","e":"(are in) the plot"}],"a":{"g":"Or do they intend a plan? But those who disbelieve - they are the object of a plan."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"إِلَهٌ","d":"ilāhun","e":"a god"},{"c":"غَيْرُ","d":"ghayru","e":"other than"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"سُبْحَانَ","d":"sub'ḥāna","e":"Glory be"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(to) Allah"},{"c":"عَمَّا","d":"ʿammā","e":"from what"},{"c":"يُشْرِكُونَ","d":"yush'rikūna","e":"they associate (with Him)"}],"a":{"g":"Or have they a deity other than Allah? Exalted is Allah above whatever they associate with Him."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"يَرَوْا","d":"yaraw","e":"they were to see"},{"c":"كِسْفًا","d":"kis'fan","e":"a portion"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"سَاقِطًا","d":"sāqiṭan","e":"falling"},{"c":"يَقُولُوا","d":"yaqūlū","e":"they will say"},{"c":"سَحَابٌ","d":"saḥābun","e":"Clouds"},{"c":"مَرْكُومٌ","d":"markūmun","e":"heaped up"}],"a":{"g":"And if they were to see a fragment from the sky falling, they would say, \"[It is merely] clouds heaped up.\""}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"فَذَرْهُمْ","d":"fadharhum","e":"So leave them"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"until"},{"c":"يُلَاقُوا","d":"yulāqū","e":"they meet"},{"c":"يَوْمَهُمُ","d":"yawmahumu","e":"their Day"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"in it"},{"c":"يُصْعَقُونَ","d":"yuṣ'ʿaqūna","e":"they will faint"}],"a":{"g":"So leave them until they meet their Day in which they will be struck insensible -"}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُغْنِي","d":"yugh'nī","e":"will avail"},{"c":"عَنْهُمْ","d":"ʿanhum","e":"to them"},{"c":"كَيْدُهُمْ","d":"kayduhum","e":"their plotting"},{"c":"شَيْئًا","d":"shayan","e":"(in) anything"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"يُنْصَرُونَ","d":"yunṣarūna","e":"will be helped"}],"a":{"g":"The Day their plan will not avail them at all, nor will they be helped."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"for those who"},{"c":"ظَلَمُوا","d":"ẓalamū","e":"do wrong"},{"c":"عَذَابًا","d":"ʿadhāban","e":"(is) a punishment"},{"c":"دُونَ","d":"dūna","e":"before"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"وَلَكِنَّ","d":"walākinna","e":"but"},{"c":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","d":"aktharahum","e":"most of them"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, for those who have wronged is a punishment before that, but most of them do not know."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"وَاصْبِرْ","d":"wa-iṣ'bir","e":"So be patient"},{"c":"لِحُكْمِ","d":"liḥuk'mi","e":"for (the) Command"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"فَإِنَّكَ","d":"fa-innaka","e":"for indeed you"},{"c":"بِأَعْيُنِنَا","d":"bi-aʿyuninā","e":"(are) in Our Eyes"},{"c":"وَسَبِّحْ","d":"wasabbiḥ","e":"And glorify"},{"c":"بِحَمْدِ","d":"biḥamdi","e":"(the) praise"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"حِينَ","d":"ḥīna","e":"when"},{"c":"تَقُومُ","d":"taqūmu","e":"you arise"}],"a":{"g":"And be patient, [O Muhammad], for the decision of your Lord, for indeed, you are in Our eyes. And exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord when you arise."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنَ","d":"wamina","e":"And of"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"the night"},{"c":"فَسَبِّحْهُ","d":"fasabbiḥ'hu","e":"glorify Him"},{"c":"وَإِدْبَارَ","d":"wa-id'bāra","e":"and after"},{"c":"النُّجُومِ","d":"l-nujūmi","e":"the stars"}],"a":{"g":"And in a part of the night exalt Him and after [the setting of] the stars."}}}